# Chapter & content

## Fixed section order

1. Title + chapter number  
2. Governing equations (KaTeX, anchors `(n.m)` → `#eq-n-m`)  
3. Scope of application  
4. Assumptions and limitations  
5. Nomenclature (Symbol · Meaning · Unit)  
6. Formula concept diagram (SVG default; R3F only if justified)  
7. Engineering note  
8. Worked examples × 2 (Physical model → Equation → Substitution → Result → Interpretation)

## Math & media

- Equations: KaTeX only — never PNG from Word
- Schematic: SVG 2D first; R3F lazy + pause off-screen + 2D fallback
- Content lives in schema modules (`src/content/`), not long hard-coded JSX
- Disclaimer: learning reference; design follows standards / manufacturer / review

## DoD (chapter done)

All 8 blocks · KaTeX + anchors · nomenclature complete · schematic + caption · 2 full examples · mobile TOC/table readable · no marketing cards on first viewport
